				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.492
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ταῦτα διείρεο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.550
				</span></i>
			, etc.: aor.
			inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διερέσθαι τινὰ ἐρώτησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phlb.</u>
					42e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διήρετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					38.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
